# A Farm renderer owns its scene and shader; the UI view and world are borrowed.
import scene_landscape.dl
import scene_characters.dl
import scene_fences.dl
import scene_flags.dl
import scene_areas.dl
import scene_markers.dl
import scene_weather.dl
import render_inputs.dl

class:
    patterns:
        website Farm renderer
    members:
        view as a pointer to UI view
        resource as a pointer
        landscape as a pointer to website Farm landscape
        characters as a pointer to website Farm characters
        fences as a pointer to website Farm fences
        flags as a pointer to website Farm flags
        areas as a pointer to website Farm areas
        markers as a pointer to website Farm markers
        weather as a pointer to website Farm weather
        dragged as a string
        bank as a pointer to UI scene mesh bank
        frame as a pointer to UI scene frame
        color binding as UI scene geometry binding
        shadow binding as UI scene geometry binding
        camera as website Farm camera
        inputs as website Farm shader inputs
        texture as UI texture
        seconds as a floating-point number
        rendered seconds as a floating-point number
        rain as a floating-point number
        rendered rain as a floating-point number
        raining as a boolean
        dirty as a boolean
        shadow dirty as a boolean
        baked as a boolean

to [supply website Farm inputs in] {a pointer to website Farm renderer:renderer}:
    for each input in renderer's inputs:
        set UI shader (renderer's resource) pass (input's pass) in (renderer's view) uniform group 0 binding (input's binding) to (input's value)

to get [a website Farm renderer for] {a pointer to website farm world:world} [in] {UI bounds:viewport} [using shader] {a pointer:resource} [in] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set result to storage for one slot initialized with (a new website Farm renderer)
    set result's view to view
    set result's resource to resource
    set result's landscape to a website Farm landscape for world
    set result's characters to website Farm characters for world in (result's landscape)
    set result's fences to website Farm fences for world in (result's landscape)
    set result's flags to website Farm flags for world in (result's landscape)
    set result's areas to website Farm areas in (result's landscape)
    set result's markers to website Farm markers in (result's landscape)
    set result's weather to website Farm weather in (result's landscape)
    ignore (update website Farm areas (result's areas) from world)
    set result's bank to a UI scene mesh bank
    set result's frame to a UI scene frame using (result's bank)
    set result's color binding to a UI scene geometry binding to (result's bank) in view shader resource pass (the website Farm surface pass)
    set result's shadow binding to a UI scene geometry binding to (result's bank) in view shader resource pass (the website Farm shadow pass)
    set result's camera to a website Farm camera in viewport
    set result's inputs to an empty list of website Farm shader input
    set result's raining to world's raining
    set result's dirty and result's shadow dirty to true
    return result

to [supply website Farm navigation] {website Farm navigation display:data} [in] {a pointer to website Farm renderer:renderer}:
    if (data is the same website Farm navigation as renderer's markers's navigation) = false:
        set renderer's markers's navigation to data
        set renderer's dirty to true

to [update website Farm renderer] {a pointer to website Farm renderer:renderer} [from] {a pointer to website farm world:world} [over] {floating-point number:duration} [seconds instantly] {boolean:instant}:
    update website Farm landscape (renderer's landscape) from world
    update website Farm characters (renderer's characters) from world over duration seconds instantly instant
    update website Farm fences (renderer's fences) from world
    update website Farm flags (renderer's flags) from world dragging (renderer's dragged)
    ignore (update website Farm areas (renderer's areas) from world)
    set renderer's raining to world's raining
    set renderer's dirty and renderer's shadow dirty to true

to get [advance website Farm renderer] {a pointer to website Farm renderer:renderer} [over] {floating-point number:seconds} [seconds dragging] {a value:dragged}:
    set renderer's seconds to renderer's seconds + seconds
    set renderer's dragged to the string form of dragged
    set camera to advance UI scene orbit (the address of (renderer's camera's orbit)) by seconds seconds
    set poses to advance website Farm characters (renderer's characters) at (renderer's seconds) over seconds seconds dragging dragged
    set gates to advance website Farm fences (renderer's fences) near (renderer's characters) over seconds seconds
    set cloth to advance website Farm flags (renderer's flags) at (renderer's seconds)
    set target to 1.0 if renderer's raining, else 0.0
    set renderer's rain to renderer's rain + (target - renderer's rain) * (the UI scene blend at rate 0.5 over seconds seconds)
    set geometry to poses or (gates or cloth)
    set renderer's dirty to renderer's dirty or (camera or geometry)
    set renderer's shadow dirty to renderer's shadow dirty or geometry
    return renderer's dirty or (seconds > 0.0)

to [upload website Farm frame in] {a pointer to website Farm renderer:renderer}:
    set frame to renderer's frame
    prepare UI scene frame frame from (renderer's landscape's objects) through (renderer's camera's orbit's camera)
    ignore (refresh UI scene geometry binding (the address of (renderer's color binding)))
    ignore (refresh UI scene geometry binding (the address of (renderer's shadow binding)))
    upload UI scene instances (frame's records) through (renderer's color binding)
    set UI shader (renderer's resource) pass (the website Farm surface pass) in (renderer's view) to draws (frame's draws' data) counting (the length of frame's draws)
    if renderer's shadow dirty:
        upload UI scene instances (frame's shadow records) through (renderer's shadow binding)
        set UI shader (renderer's resource) pass (the website Farm shadow pass) in (renderer's view) to draws (frame's shadow draws' data) counting (the length of frame's shadow draws)

to get [the rendered website Farm] {a pointer to website Farm renderer:renderer} [sized] {integer:width} [by] {integer:height} [in] {UI bounds:viewport}:
    set markers to refresh website Farm markers (renderer's markers) using (renderer's characters) dragging (renderer's dragged)
    set weather to refresh website Farm weather (renderer's weather) at amount (renderer's rain)
    set renderer's dirty to renderer's dirty or (markers or weather)
    set previous to renderer's camera's viewport
    if (previous's width != viewport's width) or (previous's height != viewport's height):
        resize website Farm camera (the address of (renderer's camera)) to viewport
        set renderer's dirty to true
    else:
        set renderer's camera's viewport to viewport
    if ((renderer's texture's width = width) and (renderer's texture's height = height)) and ((renderer's dirty = false) and ((renderer's rendered seconds = renderer's seconds) and (renderer's rendered rain = renderer's rain))):
        return renderer's texture
    if renderer's baked = false:
        prepare website Farm bake inputs in (renderer's inputs)
        supply website Farm inputs in renderer
    if renderer's dirty:
        upload website Farm frame in renderer
    prepare website Farm frame inputs in (renderer's inputs) through (renderer's camera's orbit's camera) at (renderer's seconds) with rain (renderer's rain) sized width by height
    supply website Farm inputs in renderer
    set UI shader (renderer's resource) pass (the website Farm shadow pass) in (renderer's view) enabled (renderer's shadow dirty)
    set renderer's texture to a UI texture from shader (renderer's resource) sized width by height in (renderer's view)
    if renderer's baked = false:
        loop pass from 0 to ((the website Farm scattering pass) + 1):
            set UI shader (renderer's resource) pass pass in (renderer's view) enabled false
        set renderer's baked to true
    if renderer's shadow dirty:
        set UI shader (renderer's resource) pass (the website Farm shadow pass) in (renderer's view) enabled false
    set renderer's shadow dirty and renderer's dirty to false
    set renderer's rendered seconds to renderer's seconds
    set renderer's rendered rain to renderer's rain
    return renderer's texture

to [reset website Farm renderer] {a pointer to website Farm renderer:renderer}:
    set renderer's camera to a website Farm camera in (renderer's camera's viewport)
    set renderer's seconds and renderer's rain to 0.0
    for each section in (renderer's fences's sections):
        if section's boundary's gate:
            set instance to section's object's instance
            set pose to the item at 0 in (instance's poses)
            set pose's rotation's y to 0.0
            set UI scene pose of part 0 in instance to pose
    set renderer's dirty and renderer's shadow dirty to true

to [close website Farm renderer] {a pointer to website Farm renderer:renderer}:
    close UI shader (renderer's resource) in (renderer's view)
    free renderer's inputs
    close UI scene frame (renderer's frame)
    close UI scene mesh bank (renderer's bank)
    close website Farm weather (renderer's weather)
    close website Farm markers (renderer's markers)
    close website Farm areas (renderer's areas)
    close website Farm flags (renderer's flags)
    close website Farm fences (renderer's fences)
    close website Farm characters (renderer's characters)
    close website Farm landscape (renderer's landscape)
    destroy the value at renderer
    deallocate renderer
